# Frontend (React + TS)

- Stack is fixed (SPEC §3): React 18, TypeScript strict, Vite, @tanstack/react-query,
  @tanstack/react-router, visx for charts, @fontsource self-hosted fonts.
- NO component library (no MUI/AntD/shadcn) and NO Tailwind. `src/ui/*` primitives styled
  with CSS Modules + the tokens in `src/styles/tokens.css` ARE the design system.
- Every API response is parsed with zod in `src/lib/` before use.
- Design system §4 is binding: single interactive accent `--beacon`; status colors only
  for drift semantics and always paired with a label or shape (WCAG 1.4.1); 2px
  border-radius; spacing scale 4/8/12/16/24/40; visible gridlines are part of the look.
- Typography: Bricolage Grotesque (display, sparingly), Public Sans (body),
  IBM Plex Mono (versions, namespaces, image refs, table numerics).
- Motion: 120–160ms ease-out for hover/open; the sonar sweep is the only orchestrated
  animation (≤1200ms, opacity-only); respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Microcopy per §4.6: plain verbs, sentence case; errors say cause + next step; empty
  states invite action. No lorem ipsum.
- Quality floor §4.7: responsive to 360px, `--beacon` focus rings on every interactive
  element, full keyboard navigation, WCAG 2.2 AA, text contrast ≥ 4.5:1.
- Banned looks (§4): default admin template, cream+serif+terracotta, black+acid-green,
  broadsheet hairlines, generic SaaS gradients/pills/KPI cards.
